WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.675
Let’s walk through Work the assigned queue.

00:00:02.675 --> 00:00:05.850
On this slide, work only unlocked NI and Escalation

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:09.512
records, checking the six domains and Glasl trajectory against

00:00:09.512 --> 00:00:11.113
the supplied evidence.

00:00:11.113 --> 00:00:14.537
In practice, the queue remains dependency-gated.

00:00:14.537 --> 00:00:17.212
Do not treat a locked row as permission to infer

00:00:17.212 --> 00:00:18.950
or pre-approve its result.

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:21.575
When you are ready, use Open assigned queue to

00:00:21.575 --> 00:00:23.325
move to the live surface.

00:00:23.325 --> 00:00:26.050
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:26.200
.
